# LF in the repository and in every checkout, whatever core.autocrlf says on
# the machine. Prettier writes LF (.prettierrc.json); without this, Git on
# Windows checks files out as CRLF and every one of them reads as unformatted.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.woff2 binary
